  "description": "Within Romance is a beautiful cursive signature script font inspired by the effortless charm of handwritten notes, flowing ink, and personal signatures. With its rounded letterforms, smooth curves, and natural handwritten strokes, this font brings a warm, romantic, and authentic feel to every design.\nDesigned with an elegant yet casual character, Within Romance blends the look of an inked signature with the softness of modern handwritten typography. Its flowing connections and organic shapes make it feel personal, expressive, and beautifully imperfect.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Within Romance is a beautiful cursive signature script font inspired by the effortless charm of handwritten notes, flowing ink, and personal signatures. With its rounded letterforms, smooth curves, and natural handwritten strokes, this font brings a warm, romantic, and authentic feel to every design.</p>\n<p>Designed with an elegant yet casual character, Within Romance blends the look of an inked signature with the softness of modern handwritten typography. Its flowing connections and organic shapes make it feel personal, expressive, and beautifully imperfect.</p>",
